+//                  `vy` on a top/bottom hit, `vx` on a side hit; the other
+//                  component is left exactly as it was;
+//   * corner     — equal penetrations mean a diagonal hit: flip both;
+//   * push out   — the ball is repositioned just outside the brick, otherwise
+//                  it keeps overlapping and re-flips forever (sticky bounce);
+//   * neighbours — the 8 px grid gap is smaller than the 14 px ball, so a seam
